{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"杠–余杠对偶"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"杠–余杠对偶"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>设"},{"Local":{"url":"幺半范畴","text":"幺半范畴"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C$ 具有"},{"Local":{"url":"几何实现(单纯图表的余极限)","text":"几何实现"}},{"Plain":"且单位 $1$ 是"},{"Local":{"url":"终对象","text":"终对象"}},{"Plain":". 对于"},{"Local":{"url":"结合代数","text":"结合代数"}},{"Plain":" $A$, 通过唯一的"},{"Local":{"url":"增广结合代数","text":"增广"}},{"Plain":" $A\\to 1$, 单位 $1$ 具有 $A$ 上的"},{"Local":{"url":"结合代数上的模","text":"左模"}},{"Plain":"与右模结构. 考虑"},{"Local":{"url":"双边杠构造","text":"双边杠构造"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Bar}(A) = 1\\otimes_A 1,\r\n$$\n即"},{"Local":{"url":"单纯对象","text":"单纯对象"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n1\\otimes A^{\\otimes\\bullet}\\otimes 1\r\n$$\n的"},{"Local":{"url":"几何实现(单纯图表的余极限)","text":"几何实现"}},{"Plain":", 那么该对象具有典范的"},{"Local":{"url":"结合余代数.md合","text":"结合余代数"}},{"Plain":"结构. 这给出了函子\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Bar}\\colon \\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathbb E_1}(\\mathcal C)\\to\\mathsf{Coalg}_{\\mathbb E_1}(\\mathcal C).\r\n$$</p>\n<p>注意 $\\operatorname{Coalg}(\\mathcal C) = \\mathsf{Alg}(\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}})^{\\mathrm{op}}$. 对偶地, 若"},{"Local":{"url":"幺半范畴","text":"幺半范畴"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C$ 具有余单纯极限且单位 $1$ 是"},{"Local":{"url":"始对象","text":"始对象"}},{"Plain":", 则有函子\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Cobar}\\colon \\mathsf{Coalg}_{\\mathbb E_1}(\\mathcal C)\\to \\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathbb E_1}(\\mathcal C).\r\n$$</p>\n<p>进一步, 当 $1$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"零对象","text":"零对象"}},{"Plain":"且单纯余极限, 余单纯极限都存在时, 上述两个函子构成一对"},{"Local":{"url":"伴随","text":"伴随"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Bar}\\dashv\\operatorname{Cobar},\r\n$$\n也即\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Coalg}(\\mathcal C)}(\\operatorname{Bar}(A),B)\r\n\\simeq\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Alg}(\\mathcal C)}(A,\\operatorname{Cobar}(B)).\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<h3>环路空间</h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"积幺半范畴","text":"积幺半范畴"}},{"Plain":" "},{"Local":{"url":"Ani","text":"$\\mathsf{Ani}$"}},{"Plain":" 中的杠–余杠对偶即是"},{"Local":{"url":"逆环路空间","text":"逆环路空间"}},{"Plain":"与"},{"Local":{"url":"环路空间","text":"环路空间"}},{"Plain":"的对偶.</p>\n<p>回忆, 带基点"},{"Local":{"url":"生象","text":"生象"}},{"Plain":" $X$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"环路空间","text":"环路空间"}},{"Plain":" $\\Omega X$ 具有"},{"Local":{"url":"群","text":"群"}},{"Plain":"结构, 特别地具有结合代数结构.</p>\n<p>另一个重要的事实是, 生象 $X$ 本身有结合余代数结构, 余乘法为"},{"Local":{"url":"对角线","text":"对角线"}},{"Plain":" $\\Delta\\colon X\\times X$.</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>. $(\\mathsf{Ani},\\times)$ 中每个对象上有<strong>唯一</strong>的结合余代数结构. 具体地, 遗忘函子 $\\mathsf{Coalg}(\\mathsf{Ani}) \\to \\mathsf{Ani}$ 为等价. 而 $(\\mathsf{Ani},\\times)$ 中的"},{"Local":{"url":"增广结合代数","text":"增广"}},{"Plain":"余代数则等同于带基点生象 $*\\to Y$.</p>\n<p>对于 $(\\mathsf{Ani},\\times)$ 中的"},{"Local":{"url":"结合代数","text":"结合代数"}},{"Plain":" (幺半群) $X$ 与带基点生象 $Y$, 有等价\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Ani}_{*}}(\\mathbf{B}X,Y)\r\n\\simeq\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Alg}(\\mathsf{Ani})}(X,\\Omega Y).\r\n$$\n其中\n$$\r\n\\mathbf{B}X=\\operatorname{colim}(\\cdots\\to^4 X\\times X\\to^3 X\\rightrightarrows *)=\\operatorname{Bar}(X),\r\n$$\n$$\r\n\\Omega Y =\\operatorname{lim}(\\cdots\\leftarrow^4 Y\\times Y\\leftarrow^3 Y\\leftleftarrows *) = \\operatorname{Cobar}(Y).\r\n$$</p>\n<h3>多项式环</h3>\n"}]}}